Open Editor Template

This development starter is distributed under AGPL-3.0-only.
It includes an unchanged, scoped source snapshot of Open Editor Platform:
https://github.com/ryo0221/open-editor-platform
Source commit: c5dcc2b70a6e8fc2de1c77e02d9f9855037803dd

The corresponding EP sources, upstream manifests, licensing information and
file hashes are included under vendor/ep. The selection and package metadata
changes are documented there. These files are not an official published SDK.
The upstream Independent Editor Additional Permission draft is not operative.
This repository does not grant that draft permission or offer an OEM license.

The generated extension package contains its own LICENSE and NOTICE. When
distributing a modified package, provide its corresponding source and retain
the applicable notices. The source for this starter is in this repository;
keep an exact source revision alongside any package you publish.
